# Review routing. Combined with a repository ruleset that requires review,
# this ensures no change to the schema or the specification merges unreviewed.
#
# Replace @civados/maintainers with a real team once the organization has one.
# A CODEOWNERS entry pointing at a team that does not exist silently matches
# nobody, which is worse than having no file at all.

*                                   @civados/maintainers

# The schema and the spec are the contract. Changes here are breaking changes
# by default and warrant closer review than documentation edits.
/schema/                            @civados/maintainers
/SPEC.md                            @civados/maintainers

# CI defines what "valid" means in practice.
/.github/workflows/                 @civados/maintainers
